B.Fs=new A.V(1,"Take the win",B.a6,"Four of your pieces in a line \u2014 across, up, or diagonally \u2014 ends the game. Before anything clever, check whether you already have three with an open end.",B.ai,B.IL,3,null,B.l,"Three amber sunburst pieces sit on the bottom row in columns 1, 2 and 3. Column 4 completes the row. It also happens to stop the teal diamonds doing the same thing from the other side \u2014 but you would play it anyway, because winning ends the game before any threat of theirs matters.",!0,B.i,null,null)
