B.Hm=s([0,2,0,4],t.t)
B.FF=new A.V(7,"Take the square they want",B.y,"The move that would be strongest for your opponent is often the strongest move for you. Before playing, ask what you would do if it were their turn.",B.aN,B.Hm,3,null,B.l,"If the teal diamonds get column 4, they hold three on the bottom row with both ends open and you cannot cover both. Taking that square first costs you nothing and removes the whole plan.",!0,B.i,null,null)
