B.Go=new A.V(8,"Do not build their staircase",B.y,"Your piece fills a square, and the square directly above it becomes available \u2014 to them. A move can be safe in itself and still hand over the game.",B.aI,B.Kl,null,null,B.fJ,"The teal diamonds have three in a row on the second row, needing either end. Neither end is reachable yet. Play column 2 or column 6 and your own piece becomes the step they climb. Any other column is fine.",!0,B.i,null,null)
