B.GW=new A.V(9,"Diagonals are the ones you miss",B.y,"Rows and columns are easy to scan. Diagonals cut across both and are the lines most games are actually lost to. Check them last, every single turn.",B.ae,B.KZ,4,null,B.l,"The teal diamonds run diagonally up from the bottom of column 2. Column 5 already holds three pieces, so their fourth square is reachable on their next turn. Dropping into column 5 takes it.",!0,B.i,null,null)
B.Kk=s([0,4,1,4,2,4],t.t)
B.Ff=new A.V(10,"Winning beats blocking",B.y,"If you can finish, finish. A threat you never have to face is not a threat.",B.ai,B.Kk,3,null,B.l,"The teal diamonds have three stacked in column 5 and it is tempting to block. But column 4 completes your bottom row now, and the game ends before they ever play. Check for your own win before you check for theirs.",!0,B.i,null,null)
