B.Fl=new A.V(11,"A diagonal you can finish",B.y,"Once a column has filled up under a diagonal, the square at the top of it becomes reachable \u2014 often several moves after you set the line up and stopped watching it.",B.ai,B.L7,3,null,B.l,"Your pieces climb from the bottom of column 1 to column 3. Column 4 is now three deep, so the next drop lands exactly on the fourth square of that diagonal. Lines mature; keep looking at old ones.",!0,B.i,null,null)
