B.H2=new A.V(14,"The only move on the board",B.a1,"Late in a tight game, positions stop having good moves and bad ones. They have one move and six mistakes. This is such a position, checked move by move all the way to the end of the game.",B.ee,B.J4,2,21,B.l,"Column 3 wins by force. Every other legal column throws the win away and loses. You are not expected to see 21 plies ahead \u2014 nobody does. You are expected to notice when a position has gone sharp, and to slow down when it has.",!0,B.i,null,null)
