B.FC=new A.V(16,"Stopping a stack is cheap",B.a1,"A vertical threat only ever needs one square, and that square is always the very next drop in the column. It is the one threat you can always answer directly.",B.ae,B.K9,3,null,B.l,"Three teal diamond pieces in column 4. Dropping there takes the fourth square and the threat is simply gone \u2014 no counting, no side effects. Compare that with a horizontal threat, which has two ends.",!0,B.i,null,null)
