B.F9=new A.V(19,"When you both have threats",B.a1,"Two live threats do not cancel out. The one that can be played sooner wins, and whose move it is decides that.",B.ai,B.L0,3,null,B.l,"Both sides have three on the bottom row here. It looks balanced and it is not: it is your move, so the position is simply won. When you both threaten, stop evaluating and start counting turns.",!0,B.i,null,null)
